{"id": "https://wineindustryadvisor.com/?p=170419", "url": "https://wineindustryadvisor.com/2026/10/08/andrew-jefford-what-struck-me-was-the-creativity-of-germanys-younger-winemakers/", "title": "Andrew Jefford: ‘What struck me was the creativity of Germany’s younger winemakers’", "summary": "<img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://win-advisor-media-library.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/23150922/from-the-web-placeholder-02-1-640x427.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 1px;\" title=\"decanter.com\" width=\"640\" /><p><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://win-advisor-media-library.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/23150922/from-the-web-placeholder-02-1.jpg\" title=\"decanter.com\" width=\"1280\" /></p>&#60;div class=\"author-description\"&#62;&#60;p&#62;Andrew Jefford has written for Decanter magazine since 1988.  His monthly magazine column is widely followed, and he also writes occasional features and profiles both for the magazine and for &#60;em&#62;&#60;a href=\"http://www.decanter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.decanter.com&#38;amp;source=gmail&#38;amp;ust=1636127504805000&#38;amp;usg=AFQjCNGxcmapJnpHFGMAjETz__znQ1b8Bw\"&#62;Decanter.com&#60;/a&#62;&#60;/em&#62;. He has won many awards for his work, including eight Louis Roederer Awards and eight Glenfiddich Awards. He was Regional Chair for Regional France and Languedoc-Rossillon at the inaugural Decanter World Wine Awards in 2004, and has judged in every edition of the competition since, becoming a Co-Chair in 2018. After a year as a senior research fellow at Adelaide University between 2009 and 2010, Jefford moved with his family to the Languedoc, close to Pic St-Loup. He also acts as academic advisor to The Wine Scholar Guild.&#60;/p&#62;&#60;p&#62;&#60;strong&#62;Roederer awards&#60;/strong&#62; &#60;strong&#62;2016: &#60;/strong&#62;International Wine Columnist of the Year&#60;/p&#62;&#60;/div&#62;", "content": "<img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://win-advisor-media-library.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/23150922/from-the-web-placeholder-02-1-640x427.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 1px;\" title=\"decanter.com\" width=\"640\" /><p><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://win-advisor-media-library.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/23150922/from-the-web-placeholder-02-1.jpg\" title=\"decanter.com\" width=\"1280\" /></p>&#60;div class=\"author-description\"&#62;&#60;p&#62;Andrew Jefford has written for Decanter magazine since 1988.  His monthly magazine column is widely followed, and he also writes occasional features and profiles both for the magazine and for &#60;em&#62;&#60;a href=\"http://www.decanter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.decanter.com&#38;amp;source=gmail&#38;amp;ust=1636127504805000&#38;amp;usg=AFQjCNGxcmapJnpHFGMAjETz__znQ1b8Bw\"&#62;Decanter.com&#60;/a&#62;&#60;/em&#62;. He has won many awards for his work, including eight Louis Roederer Awards and eight Glenfiddich Awards. He was Regional Chair for Regional France and Languedoc-Rossillon at the inaugural Decanter World Wine Awards in 2004, and has judged in every edition of the competition since, becoming a Co-Chair in 2018. After a year as a senior research fellow at Adelaide University between 2009 and 2010, Jefford moved with his family to the Languedoc, close to Pic St-Loup. He also acts as academic advisor to The Wine Scholar Guild.&#60;/p&#62;&#60;p&#62;&#60;strong&#62;Roederer awards&#60;/strong&#62; &#60;strong&#62;2016: &#60;/strong&#62;International Wine Columnist of the Year&#60;/p&#62;&#60;/div&#62;", "published_at": "2026-10-08 16:34:15+00:00", "source_name": "Wine Industry Advisor", "source_type": "media", "language": "en", "content_type": "market_report", "country": "US", "continent": "NEW_WORLD", "region": "Americas/North/USA", "producer_role": "trade_media", "trust_tier": "T3_professional", "info_purpose": ["P2_market_analysis"], "collection_tier": "C1_rss"}
